{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "accf85405153233585c20b7d323636774724479a606dbf50941e3fbfa4c1cd67", "ja": "これもプロデューサーさんの頑張りのおかげですね！\nどうですか、大仕事をやりきった感想は？", "zh": "这也多亏制作人先生一直以来的努力！\n怎么样，完成了一项大工作后有什么感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "5b6bd1cccb9252724520322316a67435be8e64562074385859afa337149c08af", "ja": "え。俺ですか？", "zh": "诶？我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1012_president", "source_sha256": "f82d6c4fac712970dfb82be8b94cf9c5ec3893b184f04994ea9d14340a4eb403", "ja": "おお、そうだ。ここはひとつ、責任者にスピーチして\nもらおうじゃないか。君、景気がいいのを頼むよ！", "zh": "哦，对了。那就请负责人来发表一段演讲吧。拜托你说得热闹振奋些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "3423e1a183e65c2a3a806121a7cf787196acb7f27ecadcdf20dafb7572691a9f", "ja": "わ、わかりました。コホン。\nえーっと……。", "zh": "好、好的。咳咳。\n那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "0f8d4c363e84a205879e449063d746e0ecbd94c99f0c73290e094af729aabd7d", "ja": "シアタープロジェクトが、こうして軌道に乗ったのは、\n本当にたくさんの人達のおかげです。", "zh": "剧场企划能像这样步入正轨，  \n真的要感谢许许多多的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "6887cd71dedb95e38f2920a1e33cce5530eb27390ec3357880e266dbfad74430", "ja": "ここにいるみなさん、イベントスタッフや工事関係の\n方々……そしてもちろん、アイドルのみんな。", "zh": "在这里的各位、活动工作人员和工程相关的各位……当然，还有偶像们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "c11b0f4e476ecb7db81cf5b955976323aeba6d75445c72ee53e66b9fdb3f2928", "ja": "正直、プロジェクトが始まったばかりの頃は、\n見通しも何も全然なくて。", "zh": "说实话，项目刚开始的时候，前景什么的完全看不清。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "3bc10f3e1e2e26f3668b06a8ef10604083ffa4770a14d0ad22267fb0603e5da8", "ja": "ここまで来られただけでも、\n十分満足しなくちゃいけないと思うんですけど。", "zh": "能走到这一步，就已经应该感到满足了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "5fd785a90d9732e253639b70d34b9726d5beba03ee7c55a310bfb3bf7450bef9", "ja": "今日の公演で、アイドル達のステージを見ていたら……\n欲が出てきちゃいました。", "zh": "看着偶像们在今天的公演上登台表演……我也变得贪心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1019_president", "source_sha256": "070bed53c36c279f841cb3ed70c0c57615d8b99e2133a7e7149e43f781604b14", "ja": "ほほう。どんな欲かね？", "zh": "哦？是什么欲望呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "88e1453286a8f9d96372d7d7f31717eb2f1ee5a130927e0ee625cbb709102728", "ja": "俺は……彼女達の輝く姿を、もっと見てみたいです。", "zh": "我……想更多地看到她们闪耀的身姿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_12_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "46bb80d90db4ab12166be78bd016eb86b7cc8d67cb8e51a026cb76bb27f1c004", "ja": "もっと輝いて欲しい。どこまでも駆け上がって欲しい。\n自分自身の夢をつかみとって欲しい……。", "zh": "希望她们能绽放更加耀眼的光芒。希望她们能不断攀登，直到更高更远的地方。\n希望她们能亲手抓住属于自己的梦想……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
